1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
Hadis ini menunjukkan bagaimana

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:05,570
bukan hanya sebab berdikari, perniagaan

3
00:00:05,990 --> 00:00:09,010
menjadi sebab untuk manusia kaya.

4
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:11,550
Nilai inilah yang patut diambil

5
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:13,860
berat oleh orang Islam, supaya

6
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:17,400
anak-anak terlibat dengan perniagaan.

7
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:19,480
Tapi

8
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:22,270
kita pula, bila anak belajar, kita

9
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:22,760
kata apa?

10
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:25,180
Awang, belajar rajin-rajin, nanti

11
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:27,880
dah masuk universiti, keluar boleh

12
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:30,950
kerja elok-elok, dapat kerja elok,

13
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:32,330
dapat pencen.

14
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,897
Dia nak suruh anak dia habis

15
00:00:37,897 --> 00:00:39,590
mengaji kat universiti ni kerja

16
00:00:39,590 --> 00:00:40,590
dengan orang.

17
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:43,140
Kalau anak tu nak berniaga, berniaga apa?

18
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:44,763
Belajar tinggi-tinggi berniaga?

19
00:00:44,763 --> 00:00:46,750
Berniaga ni kena ada modal, untung

20
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:48,000
belum pasti lagi.

21
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,570
Mungkin rugi, mungkin bankrap.

22
00:00:50,570 --> 00:00:52,799
Dia tak ajar anak sejak kecil,

23
00:00:52,799 --> 00:00:55,410
Awang belajar rajin-rajin, nanti

24
00:00:55,410 --> 00:00:57,450
jadi ahli perniagaan.

25
00:00:58,830 --> 00:01:00,700
Dia belajar kat universiti, okey

26
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:02,465
kerja dengan orang sekejap, tapi dia

27
00:01:02,465 --> 00:01:04,060
nak berniaga, ambil pengalaman

28
00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:05,730
orang, mudah-mudahan berjaya.

29
00:01:05,730 --> 00:01:08,190
Sebab kalau kerja dengan orang, nak

30
00:01:08,190 --> 00:01:11,330
kaya, boleh, tapi tidak akan sekaya-kaya.

31
00:01:11,330 --> 00:01:13,750
Kerana gaji ada had.

32
00:01:13,750 --> 00:01:15,030
Orang gaji lima ribu, ni sepuluh

33
00:01:15,030 --> 00:01:16,140
ribu, dua puluh ribu.

34
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:18,010
Tapi perniagaan, dia tak ada had.

35
00:01:18,010 --> 00:01:18,810
Hari ni dia untung,

36
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:21,450
besok mungkin seratus, lusa mungkin

37
00:01:21,450 --> 00:01:23,290
seribu, tulat mungkin empat ribu.

38
00:01:23,290 --> 00:01:25,380
Nak banyak, berniaga

39
00:01:26,463 --> 00:01:27,663
banyak.

40
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:29,880
Tapi kalau berniaga, hari ni mungkin

41
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:31,600
empat ribu, besok mungkin seratus,

42
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,720
lusa mungkin sepuluh ribu, atas

43
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:35,200
usaha masing-masing.

44
00:01:35,370 --> 00:01:37,600
Jadi Islam mengajar ilmu ini.
